==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Cannot use [[Bebe (Uber Rare Cat)|Bebe]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Dessert Witch - Obsession]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
None of the enemies stand close enough to protect the boss from [[Li'l Madoka (Rare Cat)|Li'l Madoka's]] [[Long Distance]] attack, so along with [[My Very Best Friend (Combo)]] to multiply [[Witch Killer]], the boss can be rapidly killed by her, and then any [[Anti-Floating Cats]] can be used on the support, which is still fairly weak. Bebe can't save you here. To speed up this process or if Madoka is not available, just use any other Cats that outrange the enemies, like [[King Dragon Cat]] along with meatshields.

